-- In such a hypothetical case, Q1 would compute COUNT(DISTINCT PRODUCT_KEY) for customer 1 as 1, while a version of Q2 that did not eliminate duplicates would erroneously count 2 rows. 
-- However, as written and given the schema, both queries always yield the same result.

